sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant E as Decision Engine
    participant P as Policy (policy.yml)
    participant D as Diagnosis Agent
    participant C as Communication Agent
    participant U as Console / Slack
    participant A as Approval Service
    participant S as Expiry Sweep
    participant X as Recovery Executor
    participant G as dbt + Publication Gate

    Note over E: Incident is UNKNOWN or low-confidence rule match
    E->>P: Agents allowed? (agents.enabled, residency/BAA/no-training refs, kill switch)
    alt Not allowed
        E->>E: Escalate to a person (no AI call), publication stays HELD
    else Allowed
        E->>E: Build MASKED context: counts, check names, evidence refs, log text marked as data
        E->>D: Send masked incident context
        D-->>E: JSON: facts with evidence refs, hypotheses, action + parameters, confidence
        E->>E: Record provenance (agent, model, prompt, policy versions)
        E->>E: Validate schema, evidence refs exist, action in catalog and not never-auto, parameters inside incident scope, confidence ≥ 0.80
        alt Invalid output, timeout or platform error
            E->>E: Escalate as unknown, publication stays HELD
        else Valid proposal
            E->>A: Create approval PENDING (expiry, fingerprint over incident, action, params, evidence, policy version)
            E->>C: Ask for a plain-language summary only
            C-->>E: Summary text (no PHI)
            E->>U: Card: FACTS from the approval record (action, dataset, date, counts, fingerprint) + AI summary
            alt Approver answers
                U->>A: Approve / Reject (signed, Slack: signature, timestamp, channel, replay check)
                A->>A: Approver = data owner of this dataset, not the requester, not an agent
                A->>A: Atomic PENDING → APPROVED or REJECTED (duplicate returns existing outcome)
                A->>E: Outcome
            else No answer before expiry
                S->>A: PENDING → EXPIRED
                A->>E: Outcome EXPIRED
            end
            E->>P: Re-check: fingerprint unchanged, incident still open, same policy version, kill switch off, attempt below cap
            alt Approved and re-check passes
                E->>X: Authorise the approved catalog action
                X->>X: Journal before, run action, journal after
                X->>G: Rebuild and re-run all blocking checks
                G-->>E: Verification result
                alt All blocking checks pass
                    G->>G: Publish verified day to analytics
                    E->>E: Incident RESOLVED
                else Checks still fail
                    E->>E: Attempt < 2: decide again (new proposal and approval) / else escalate, HELD
                end
            else Rejected, expired, stale or re-check failed
                E->>E: Escalate, publication stays HELD
            end
        end
    end
